sequenceDiagram
autonumber

actor FE as Frontend / Postman
participant GW as Gateway :8099
participant GSF as GatewaySecurityFilter
participant AUTH as Auth Service
participant SET as Setting Service
participant ALA as AuditLogFilter (Auth)
participant ALS as AuditLogFilter (Setting)
participant AAL as Auth AuditLog Table
participant SAL as Setting AuditLog Table

rect rgb(245,245,245)
Note over FE,SET: JWT + Routing
FE->>GW: POST protected endpoint + Bearer token
GW->>GSF: Validate token
alt token invalid
    GSF-->>FE: 401 Unauthorized
else token valid
    GSF->>GSF: Extract companyId claim\nInject X-Company-Id
    opt audit payload present
        GSF->>GSF: Validate payload.username == token.subject
        alt mismatch
            GSF-->>FE: 403 Invalid username
        end
    end
    alt /api/v1/auth/**
        GW->>AUTH: Forward
    else /api/v1/setting/**
        GW->>SET: Forward
    end
end
end

rect rgb(245,245,245)
Note over AUTH,SAL: Audit Logging (POST)
AUTH->>ALA: Capture endpoint + payload + principal
ALA->>AAL: Save audit row\n(username,channel,ip,userAgent,message,event)

SET->>ALS: Capture endpoint + payload + principal
ALS->>SAL: Save audit row\n(username,channel,ip,userAgent,message,event)
end

rect rgb(245,245,245)
Note over FE,GW: CORS
FE->>GW: Browser request from UI origin
GW-->>FE: CORS headers
Note over FE,GW: Duplicate Access-Control-Allow-Origin will block browser even with backend 200.
end
